WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Open Settings from the app header.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.300
Choose Defaults & Presets and wait for the Live Preview to load.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.400
Select Highlight, change its colour and opacity, and watch the sample PDF update.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.200
Choose Strikethrough and change its saved appearance.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:23.000
Select Cross Mark and adjust its size, thickness and opacity in the preview.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Open Image presets, select a saved logo, and change its size, position and page anchor.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.300
Open Document tools and select the saved Watermark defaults.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:42.800
Change the watermark colour and review the updated DRAFT preview.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.230
Choose Save Settings to keep the new defaults and presets.
